// is_empty() must return true for this, but pushing it raw into out must NOT append it.
b.push(PromptSlot::Plan, "");
// Sentinel: insert a marker around the empty Plan push to detect accidental emission.
// E.g. use a debug-instrumented variant, or simply assert byte length matches sum of non-empty contents.
